    "extract": "Jeffrey Bowyer-Chapman is a Canadian actor, model, and television personality. He is known for appearances in films and television, most notably as Jay in the Lifetime dark comedy-drama series Unreal (2015–2018) and as one of the main judges on the first season of Canada's Drag Race (2020).",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Jeffrey Bowyer-Chapman</b> is a Canadian actor, model, and television personality. He is known for appearances in films and television, most notably as Jay in the Lifetime dark comedy-drama series <i>Unreal</i> (2015–2018) and as one of the main judges on the first season of <i>Canada's Drag Race</i> (2020).</p>"
